{"id":"473e4015-76d6-4a52-a78c-5de92ed10c94","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"b068a1a3b25473b8","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/shell.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"93417355dc594904b89fe84cf07cc380f1737d79","start":7274,"end":7338},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","scheme","=","window",".","matchMedia","(","\"","(prefers-color-scheme: dark)","\"",")"]},"context":{"before":"9dc8a7a4db04343a","after":"ad3e48611d39641c"}},"payload":{"text":"The editor (workbench iframe) follows the OS theme too. The shell is the source of truth for the OS\npreference — it reliably gets prefers-color-scheme changes, whereas the iframe may not — so publish the\nscheme (initially + on change) and let workbench-entry.tsx set the editor theme from it.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:39:13.470Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:39:13.470Z"}
{"id":"56b77fdd-a50e-42d1-aeb9-1b2d2cb1db80","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"9e9e2c14c4ff94e7","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/shell.tsx","baseline":{"blob":"9c01e9c9c9cba7448e5c37cc432e55d540c8caf0","start":3078,"end":3131},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","PANE","=","{","\"","asideDefault","\"",":","380",",","\"","asideMin","\"",":","300","}"]},"context":{"before":"14392047dce81fa3","after":"5fbcf0d55bf2a1cf"}},"payload":{"text":"The resizable pane's limits (px). The min keeps it usable, the max caps it at a fraction of the viewport so it can't\nswallow the editor.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:39:41.120Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:39:41.120Z"}
